&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ONYX GALAXY&lt;/strong&gt; by Khadlaj — 100 ML EDP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bold, cosmic unisex fragrance that radiates power and mystery. Onyx Galaxy opens with a vibrant citrus-fruit burst, deepens into a rich spicy-floral heart, and settles into a warm, lasting base of woods and musk — leaving an intense, unforgettable trail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Unisex&lt;/p&gt;
